      "created_at": "2019-06-04T00:02:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"erik78\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/ea5d25/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> erik78:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nice. Will these be for sale as an expansion with real playermats at some point ?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Just to make completely clear, the versions I made/posted are completely free, not for commercial purposes/resale at all, and are <strong>NOT</strong> the final versions of the Spirits that will be included for retail sale with Jagged Earth; they are just reproductions of the publicly released/“in-testing” versions of the Spirits that have been released at conventions, in press materials, etc.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So will “these” (as in “these exact versions that are on the website”) be for sale?&nbsp; No; I made and posted them just so S.I. addicts out there like me could get an early taste and have some fun with the spirits before they are finalized.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Will “these” (as in “spirits that look and play similarly to the versions posted on the website”) be for sale?&nbsp;&nbsp; Yes, with Jagged Earth (<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/spirit-island-jagged-earth\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/spirit-island-jagged-earth</a>).</p>",
